---
/**
 * Solution Stack — 1+2 asymmetric grid with numbered outcomes.
 * Mirrors ProblemAgitation's numbering (01, 02, 03) as a visual callback:
 * "those were your problems, these are your answers."
 * Hardcoded content — no props needed.
 */
---

<section id="solution" class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]">
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 md:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32">

    <!-- Section title -->
    <div class="mb-10 md:mb-14 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-default">
        Here's what changes.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- 1+2 asymmetric grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-6">

      <!-- Card 01 — spans left column, full height -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 md:row-span-2 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-l-accent border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
        <span class="text-sm font-mono text-muted mb-4 block">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-default mb-3">
          See your numbers. Actually see them.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Walk in Monday morning and know where every job stands &mdash; accurate and updated automatically.
          Not a guess. Not a phone call.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 02 — top right -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
        <span class="text-sm font-mono text-muted mb-4 block">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-default mb-3">
          Decide with confidence, not instinct.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Know which jobs to take, which quotes to raise, which clients actually make you money &mdash;
          and stop leaving margin on the table.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 03 — bottom right -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
        <span class="text-sm font-mono text-muted mb-4 block">03</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-default mb-3">
          Get back to leading.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Your team gets the answers they need without calling you.
          Stop being the most expensive detective in the building.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
